; Lili, sketch D "Toy Soldier Tuba": G minor, 124 bpm. A low horn marches the dotted hook like a wind-up tuba over a syncopated fuzz-bass groove, a sparse harp answer, kick-and-clap drums and timpani. Original notes, AW2 voices, no rom lines.
